# API Information


main: {
  kit: {
    info: {
      contact: {
        url: "https://www.dingconnect.com/Api"
      }
      description: `The DingConnect mobile top-up API (Ding / Ezetop Unlimited Company, Dublin): catalogue discovery (countries, providers, products, promotions), account lookup, price estimation, and instant top-up transfers to 5B+ phones worldwide.

This definition was authored by Voxgig from DingConnect's public developer documentation (dingconnect.com/Api) and the community Go client vlab-research/go-dingconnect, because DingConnect's own swagger definition requires an API key to download. DingConnect's docs invite generating client SDKs from the swagger definition; replace this file with the first-party definition when a key is available.

Application-level failure is reported in the body with HTTP 200: ResultCode (1 success, 2 partial, 4 failed) is the real signal, with ErrorCodes enumerated by GetErrorCodeDescriptions.`
      security: {
        in: "header"
        name: "api_key"
        prefix: ""
        scheme: "ApiKeyAuth"
        type: "apiKey"
      }
      servers: [
        {
          description: "Production (no sandbox; use SendTransfer.ValidateOnly for dry runs)"
          url: "https://api.dingconnect.com/api/V1"
        }
      ]
      summary: "The DingConnect mobile top-up API (Ding / Ezetop Unlimited Company, Dublin): catalogue discovery (countries, providers, products, promotions), account lookup, price estimation, and instant top-up transfers to 5B+ phones worldwide."
      title: "DingConnect API"
      version: "V1"
      website: "https://www.dingconnect.com/Api"
    }
  }
}

